{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The shaved ice shop</strong> is a cozy horror game where you manage a shaved ice shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shop is small, quiet, almost comforting. You serve shave ice, coffee, milkshakes\u2014simple things, familiar things. Yet every night feels a little different. The silence stretches longer, shadows seem to settle where they shouldn\u2019t, and the faces that sit across the counter stay in your memory long after they\u2019ve gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061260/extras/046e9e0386d871ed943cd1c6dd338197.poster.avif?t=1764781345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061260/extras/046e9e0386d871ed943cd1c6dd338197.webm?t=1764781345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061260/extras/046e9e0386d871ed943cd1c6dd338197.mp4?t=1764781345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s cozy. It\u2019s ordinary. And it\u2019s not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061260/extras/81aedc62a391f6f16da999f1197ad5f5.poster.avif?t=1764781345\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061260/extras/81aedc62a391f6f16da999f1197ad5f5.webm?t=1764781345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061260/extras/81aedc62a391f6f16da999f1197ad5f5.mp4?t=1764781345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></p><ul class=\